/// The runtime in Auk (docs/self-host-plan.md, Phase 7): the module root of the `auk_rt`
/// package. build.sh compiles it with `auk build --lib` (every module of src/, the `export fn`s
/// external under their C names) and links the object with the C modules not ported yet
/// (runtime/c) into libauk_rt.a, the bitcode into auk_rt.bc. The modules:
/// - `abi`: auk_rt.h's types and constants as raw structs, unions and `raw let`s;
/// - `cfacts`: the C library's facts for the target (`cfacts.<os>-<arch>.auk`, generated by
///   runtime/gen/cfacts.sh);
/// - ported from runtime/c: `value`, `err`, `catch`, `pixels`.
